      "value": "Requirements extracted from Zimmermann Functional Requirements excel, downloaded July 3rd, 2026 after all requirements were confirmed. Req ID prefix: **GC**.\n\n⚠️ **Rows with strikethrough are out of scope** — struck through in the Excel source file.\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Req ID | Functional Area | Sub-Functional Area | Requirement | Owner | Storefront | Status | Comments | User Story Link |\n| GC-001 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | PDP - Physical Gift Card | The system will allow customers to purchase a physical or digital gift card by selecting an amount from fixed denominations ($100, $200, $250, $300, $500), entering sender name, recipient name, recipient email address, a delivery date, and an optional personal message. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-001> |\n| GC-002 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | PDP - Physical Gift Card | The system will present the amount selection as a searchable dropdown showing fixed denominations. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-002> |\n| GC-003 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | PDP - Digital Gift Card | The system will allow customers to purchase a physical or digital gift card by selecting an amount from fixed denominations ($100, $200, $250, $300, $500), entering sender name, recipient name, recipient email address, a delivery date, and an optional personal message. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-003> |\n| GC-004 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | PDP - Digital Gift Card | The system will present the amount selection as a searchable dropdown showing fixed denominations. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-004> |\n| GC-005 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | PDP - Digital Gift Card | The system will display a date picker calendar for the delivery date field, allowing the customer to navigate between months and select a future delivery date. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-005> |\n| GC-006 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | PDP - Digital Gift Card | The system will restrict the delivery date selection to within 3 months from the current date; dates beyond 3 months will be greyed out and unavailable for selection. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-006> |\n| GC-007 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | PDP - Digital Gift Card | The system will validate the recipient email address field on the Digital Gift Card PDP to ensure it is in a valid email format before the customer can add to bag. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-007> |\n| GC-008 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | PDP - Digital Gift Card | The system will allow the sender and recipient to be the same person; the customer may enter their own name and email address as both sender and recipient. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-008> |\n| GC-009 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Mini Cart - Physical & Digital Gift Cards | The system will display the gift card in the mini cart showing: gift card image, price, and quantity only. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-009> |\n| GC-010 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Mini Cart - Physical & Digital Gift Cards | The system will provide MOVE TO WISHLIST (Physical cards only) and REMOVE actions on the gift card line item in the mini cart. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-010> |\n| GC-011 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Cart - Digital Gift Card | The system will display the digital gift card in the full cart showing gift card image, price, quantity, sender name, recipient name, recipient email, delivery date, and message. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-011> |\n| GC-012 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Cart - Digital Gift Card | The system will allow the customer to adjust the quantity of the gift card in the cart. | Dependent SF Functionality | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-012> |\n| GC-013 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Cart - Digital Gift Card | The system will provide EDIT, ~~MOVE TO WISHLIST~~, and REMOVE actions on the gift card line item in the cart (note: edit function is exclusive to digital gift cards) | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-013> |\n| GC-014 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Cart - Digital Gift Card | The system will navigate the customer back to the Digital Gift Card PDP with all previously entered details pre-populated when the customer selects EDIT from the cart. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-014> |\n| GC-015 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Cart - Digital Gift Card | The system will display the CTA as \"Update Bag\" in place of \"Add to Bag\" when the customer is editing an existing gift card in the cart. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-015> |\n| GC-016 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Cart - Physical Gift Card | The system will display the digital gift card in the full cart showing gift card image, price, quantity | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-016> |\n| GC-017 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Cart - Physical Gift Card | The system will allow the customer to adjust the quantity of the gift card in the cart. | Dependent SF Functionality | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-017> |\n| GC-018 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Cart - Physical Gift Card | The system will provide MOVE TO WISHLIST, and REMOVE actions on the gift card line item in the cart | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-018> |\n| GC-019 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Cart - Physical & Digital Gift Card | The system will apply a default maximum purchase quantity of 3 units per size across all SKUs, including gift cards | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-019> |\n| GC-020 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Cart - Physical & Digital Gift Card | The system will treat both physical and digital gift cards as tax exempt across all storefronts | AP21 | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-020> |\n| GC-021 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Cart - Physical & Digital Gift Card | The system will allow a customer to purchase a physical and digital gift card together in the same order | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-021> |\n| GC-022 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Checkout - Order Summary | The system will display the gift card in the checkout order summary showing gift card image, price, and quantity. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-022> |\n| GC-023 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Checkout - Digital Card Only | The system will bypass the shipping address and delivery method steps at checkout when the cart contains only a digital gift card, proceeding directly to payment | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-023> |\n| GC-024 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Checkout - Digital Card Only | The system will suppress the Collect from Boutique delivery option when the cart contains a digital gift card | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-024> |\n| GC-025 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Checkout - Digital Card + Normal Product | The system will follow the standard checkout flow including shipping address and delivery method when the cart contains a digital gift card alongside a physical product | Dependent SF Functionality | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-025> |\n| GC-026 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Checkout - Digital Card + Normal Product | The system will suppress the Collect from Boutique delivery option regardless of the eligibility of the physical product in the cart | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-026> |\n| GC-027 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Checkout - Physical Gift Card Only | The system will follow the standard checkout flow including shipping address and delivery method | Dependent SF Functionality | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-027> |\n| GC-028 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Checkout - Physical Gift Card Only | The system will not restrict the Collect from Boutique delivery option for physical gift cards | Dependent SF Functionality | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-028> |\n| GC-029 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Checkout - Physical Gift Card Only + Normal Product | The system will follow the standard checkout flow including shipping address and delivery method | Dependent SF Functionality | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-029> |\n| GC-030 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Checkout - Physical Gift Card Only + Normal Product | The system will not restrict the Collect from Boutique delivery option for physical gift cards | Dependent SF Functionality | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-030> |\n| GC-031 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Payment - All Cart Combinations | The system will hide the gift card payment method at checkout if a physical or digital gift card is already present in the cart | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-031> |\n| GC-032 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Checkout - Order Confirmation | The system will trigger order confirmation communications via Narvar for all domestic orders | NewStore | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-032> |\n| GC-033 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Checkout - Order Confirmation | The system will trigger order confirmation communications via Global-e for all international orders | Tryzens | EU, US, HK, ME (International only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-033> |\n| GC-034 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Redeeming a Gift Card/Credit Note - Gift Card Entry | The system will display a gift card number field and a PIN field when the Gift Card payment tab is selected. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-034> |\n| GC-035 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Redeeming a Gift Card/Credit Note - Gift Card Entry | The system will require the customer to enter both a gift card number and PIN before applying | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-035> |\n| GC-036 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Redeeming a Gift Card/Credit Note - Gift Card Entry | The system will treat credit note entry and redemption at checkout identically to gift cards - the same card number and PIN entry mechanism applies with no distinction between the two | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-036> |\n| GC-037 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Redeeming a Gift Card/Credit Note - Gift Card Entry | The system will display a CHECK BALANCE link at the gift card entry field, allowing the customer to verify their available balance before applying. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-037> |\n| GC-038 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Redeeming a Gift Card/Credit Note - Gift Card Entry | The system will display instructional text prompting the customer to click Apply after entering each gift card. | Zimmermann | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-038> |\n| GC-039 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Redeeming a Gift Card/Credit Note - Gift Card Entry | The system will validate the gift card number and PIN against GiveX in real time when the customer selects APPLY, returning the available balance and applying it against the order total | Accenture (direct integration to Give-X) | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-039> |\n| GC-040 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Redeeming a Gift Card/Credit Note - Gift Card Entry | The system will allow a customer to remove an applied gift card or credit note from checkout and revert to another payment method | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimme