    "type": "page",
    "created": "",
    "updated": "",
    "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/339935377",
    "space": {
      "key": "SFCC",
      "name": "Adobe SFCC"
    },
    "version": 2,
    "attachments": [],
    "content": {
      "value": "Overview\n--------\n\nOrder management configuration in BM defines how orders are numbered, sequenced, and exported. Order number format is a critical decision — once orders start flowing in production it cannot be changed without significant operational disruption. The NewStore OMS integration depends on SFCC order export format matching exactly what NewStore expects via MuleSoft.\n\n**📎 Salesforce Reference:** [Validate Ordering Configuration — Trailhead](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/b2c-solution-functional-launch-readiness/b2c-review-business-manager)  \n**📎 Salesforce Docs:** [Order Sequence Numbers in Business Manager](https://documentation.b2c.commercecloud.salesforce.com/DOC2/topic/com.demandware.dochelp/Ordering/OrderNumbering.html)  \n**📎 Salesforce Docs:** [Order Export Jobs](https://documentation.b2c.commercecloud.salesforce.com/DOC2/topic/com.demandware.dochelp/Jobs/OrderExport.html)\n\n**⚠️ Risk note:** Site-specific sequence numbers must be configured for order number, invoice number, shipment number, and gift certificate. These must be agreed with operations before any production orders flow — changing them retroactively is extremely disruptive and may cause duplicates in NewStore.\n\n---\n\nChecklist\n---------\n\n### Order Sequence Numbers (BM: Merchant Tools → Ordering → Order Settings)\n\nincompleteOrder number sequence configured per site — prefix/format agreed with operations team\nincompleteInvoice number sequence configured\nincompleteShipment number sequence configured\nincompleteGift certificate sequence configured (if gift cards are in scope)\nincompleteSequence numbers are site-specific (AU and UK must have distinct order number ranges)\nincompleteStarting sequence numbers confirmed to not overlap with existing Magento order numbers\n\n### Order Export Configuration\n\nincompleteOrder export job scheduled on production — **recommended every 5 minutes**\nincompleteOrder export format matches what MuleSoft/NewStore expects (confirmed with integration team)\nincompleteOrder export to NewStore tested end-to-end — order placed in SFCC → received in NewStore\nincompleteOrder export job alert email recipients configured — not personal/contractor emails\n\n### Tax & Duties on Orders\n\nincompleteAvalara tax calculation applied correctly on domestic orders (AU, UK, US Domestic, EU Domestic)\nincompleteGlobal-e handling tax for international storefronts (not SFCC native tax)\nincompleteTax codes configured correctly per product category\n\n### Returns / Narvar\n\nincompleteNarvar integration configured with production credentials\nincompleteReturn authorisation (RA) flow working: Narvar returns portal → SFCC order data → NewStore\nincompleteReturns data flowing back to AP21 for inventory reconciliation\n\n### In-Progress Orders at Cutover\n\nincompleteDecision made on handling orders in-progress at cutover (flagged as explicit open item in data migration strategy)\nincompleteOperational decision documented and communicated to the ops team\nincompleteOrders post-cutover confirmed to be served via NewStore API (orders not migrated from Magento — out of scope)\n\n\n---\n\nNotes / Findings\n----------------\n\n*Record gaps, decisions, and owner for remediation here.*\n\n| Finding | Severity | Owner | Resolved |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  |  |  |",
      "format": "markdown"
    },
    "emoji": "1f4cb",
    "page_width": "full-width"
  }
}"}

