    "content": {
      "value": "Overview\n--------\n\nSingle source of truth for all Global-e configuration values across Zimmermann SFCC environments.\n\n**Related tickets:**[SFCC-421](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-421) · [SFCC-427](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-427)\n\n---\n\nStatus\n------\n\n| Group | Status | Blocker |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `geApiUrl` | ✅ Confirmed | — |\n| `geClientJsBaseUrl` | ✅ Confirmed | — |\n| `geMerchantGuid` | ✅ Confirmed | — |\n| `geClientJsMerchantId` | ✅ Confirmed | — |\n| API Key / Shared Secret | ⏳ Pending | Global-e PM handoff |\n| SCAPI Preferences (7 vars) | ⏳ Pending | Global-e onboarding + TSD-421 sign-off |\n| BM Feature Switch — SCAPI Hook Execution | ⏳ Pending | Manual verify per env |\n| BM Payment Processor — GLOBALE | ⏳ Pending | Manual verify per env |\n| BM Order Preferences — Storefront Access | ⏳ Pending | Manual verify per env |\n| CSP frame-src / postMessage origin | ⏳ Pending | Global-e PM handoff |\n\n---\n\n1. Environment URLs\n-------------------\n\n### Global-e Account Mapping\n\nAll non-production SFCC environments connect to the Global-e **QA-INT** account. Production connects to the Global-e **Production** account. Confirmed by Global-e PM, 27 Aug 2026.\n\n| SFCC Environment | Global-e Account |\n| --- | --- |\n| Sandboxes, Development, Staging | QA-INT |\n| Production | Production |\n\n### geApiUrl\n\n| SFCC Environment | geApiUrl |\n| --- | --- |\n| dev, sit, test, UAT, Staging PIG | `https://connect.bglobale.com` |\n| Production PIG | `https://api.global-e.com/` |\n\n### geClientJsBaseUrl\n\nFull SDK URI: `{geClientJsBaseUrl}/merchant/clientsdk/{geClientJsMerchantId}`\n\n| SFCC Environment | geClientJsBaseUrl |\n| --- | --- |\n| dev, sit, test, UAT, Staging PIG | `https://www.bglobale.com` |\n| Production PIG | `https://web.global-e.com` |\n| Production PIG (CDN) | `https://webservices.global-e.com` |\n\n---\n\n2. Merchant Identifiers\n-----------------------\n\nEUIntl and ME share Global-e account 2808. HK and USIntl share account 2810. Confirm with Global-e PM whether shared-account grouping affects any per-site behaviour beyond the GUID.\n\n| Site | `geClientJsMerchantId` | `geMerchantGuid` |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ZimmermannEUIntl | `2808` | `7EA7FF8B-BCA2-4CB8-B69E-262668BCDF52` |\n| ZimmermannME | `2808` | `7EA7FF8B-BCA2-4CB8-B69E-262668BCDF52` |\n| ZimmermannHK | `2810` | `2AEE8640-DDC2-4220-9AA1-1EEF811EF061` |\n| ZimmermannUSIntl | `2810` | `2AEE8640-DDC2-4220-9AA1-1EEF811EF061` |\n\n**Still required from Global-e PM:**\n\n| Credential | Purpose | Status |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| API Key / Shared Secret | Back-end request auth | ⏳ Pending |\n| CSP `frame-src` value | Allows checkout iframe | ⏳ Pending |\n| postMessage trusted origin | iframe postMessage validation | ⏳ Pending |\n\n---\n\n3. SCAPI Site Preferences\n-------------------------\n\nManaged via `data/vendor/globale-metadata/sites/*/preferences.xml` using envsubst injection — see TSD-SFCC-421. All four sites share one `GLOBALE_*` set per environment. Credentials in GitHub Actions encrypted secrets only — never commit to source control.\n\n| Preference | GH Variable | Secret? | dev | sit | test | uat | staging | prod |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `geSCAPIOrganizationId` | `GLOBALE_ORG_ID` | No | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ |\n| `geSCAPIShortCode` | `GLOBALE_SHORT_CODE` | No | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ |\n| `geSCAPIVersion` | `GLOBALE_VERSION` | No | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ |\n| `geSCAPIRedirectURI` | `GLOBALE_REDIRECT_URI` | No | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ |\n| `geSCAPIAuthType` | `GLOBALE_AUTH_TYPE` | No | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ |\n| `geSCAPIClientId` | `GLOBALE_CLIENT_ID` | **Yes** | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ |\n| `geSCAPIClientSecret` | `GLOBALE_CLIENT_SECRET` | **Yes** | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ | ⏳ |\n\n---\n\n4. BM Configuration\n-------------------\n\nManual verification required per environment. Gap items #9/#10 from SFCC-131.\n\n| BM Location | Item | Required State | Status |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Administration → Feature Switches | Enable SCAPI Hook Execution | Enabled (shared with Avalara — must confirm per env) | ⏳ |\n| Merchant Tools → Payment Methods | `GLOBALE` payment processor | Exists and active | ⏳ |\n| Merchant Tools → Site Preferences → Order | Storefront Order Access allow-list | Global-e callback origin added | ⏳ |\n\n---\n\n5. Change Log\n-------------\n\n| Date | Note |\n| --- | --- |\n| 27 Aug 2026 | Global-e account mapping confirmed by Global-e PM: sandboxes/dev/staging → QA-INT account; production → Production account |\n| 27 Aug 2026 | `geClientJsBaseUrl` confirmed as `https://www.bglobale.com` for all non-prod tiers (QA-INT account); `www2` subdomain from Global-e public docs does not apply to Zimmermann's environment setup |\n| 20 Aug 2026 | Merchant IDs and GUIDs confirmed: EUIntl + ME share account 2808, HK + USIntl share account 2810 |\n| 20 Aug 2026 | `geApiUrl` confirmed per environment |\n| 20 Aug 2026 | `geClientJsBaseUrl` sourced from Global-e public docs |\n| 14 Aug 2026 | SCAPI envsubst approach confirmed in TSD-SFCC-421 v0.2, pending Tech Lead sign-off |",
